 520:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu_dmp_motion_driver.c ****  *  @brief      Push gyro and accel orientation to the DMP.
 521:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu_dmp_motion_driver.c ****  *  The orientation is represented here as the output of
 522:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu_dmp_motion_driver.c ****  *  @e inv_orientation_matrix_to_scalar.
 523:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu_dmp_motion_driver.c ****  *  @param[in]  orient  Gyro and accel orientation in body frame.
 524:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu_dmp_motion_driver.c ****  *  @return     0 if successful.
 525:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu_dmp_motion_driver.c ****  */
